{
  "id": "solving_first_degree_equations_with_two_unknowns",
  "title": "Solving First Degree Equations with Two Unknowns",
  "description": "Online calculator and solving procedure for two equations with two unknowns. Solve systems of first degree equations in the form: a1*x + b1*y = c1 and a2*x + b2*y = c2",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Solving First Degree Equations with Two Unknowns\n\nFirst degree equations with two unknowns can be expressed as:\n\n**Equation 1:** a₁x + b₁y = c₁  \n**Equation 2:** a₂x + b₂y = c₂\n\n## Solution Method\n\nThis calculator solves the system using the elimination/substitution method:\n\n1. Rearrange equation 1 to express y in terms of x\n2. Substitute into equation 2 to solve for x\n3. Back-substitute to find y\n\n## Example\n\nFor the equations:\n- 3x + 5y = 7\n- 4x - 3y = 19\n\nThe solution is: **x = 4, y = -1**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "label": "a₁ (Coefficient of x in Equation 1)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "b1",
          "label": "b₁ (Coefficient of y in Equation 1)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "label": "c₁ (Constant in Equation 1)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "a2",
          "label": "a₂ (Coefficient of x in Equation 2)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "b2",
          "label": "b₂ (Coefficient of y in Equation 2)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": -3
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "label": "c₂ (Constant in Equation 2)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 19
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "x",
          "label": "x (Solution)",
          "formula": "(inputs.c1 * inputs.b2 - inputs.c2 * inputs.b1) / (inputs.a1 * inputs.b2 - inputs.a2 * inputs.b1)",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "y",
          "label": "y (Solution)",
          "formula": "(inputs.a1 * inputs.c2 - inputs.a2 * inputs.c1) / (inputs.a1 * inputs.b2 - inputs.a2 * inputs.b1)",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "determinant",
          "label": "Determinant",
          "formula": "inputs.a1 * inputs.b2 - inputs.a2 * inputs.b1",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Linear Equations Visualization"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Equation 1: a₁x + b₁y = c₁",
            "Equation 2: a₂x + b₂y = c₂"
          ]
        },
        "grid": {
          "left": "10%",
          "right": "10%",
          "bottom": "10%",
          "top": "15%",
          "containLabel": true
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "x"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "y"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Equation 1: a₁x + b₁y = c₁",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [
              [
                -5,
                5.4
              ],
              [
                10,
                -5.4
              ]
            ],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#5470c6"
            }
          },
          {
